s assumed to be the same as\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"A reduction in shortfall indicates progress specific to an individual racial and ethnic group without the need for a reference group\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Monthly reductions in shortfall were calculated as percent decrease in shortfall compared with the preceding month.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analyses were conducted using R statistical software (version 4.2.1; R Foundation).\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}